Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么变了  很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's changed. It's big.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟上帝一样大  跟路西法一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big as God. Big as Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总得有人做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:08.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉  你长大就会成为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, I am what you are becoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝把我关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}God locked me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是为满足他自己的自大\N{\fnArial\fs30}All for his own ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:16.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得专注于我们的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must stay fixed on our purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.51,0:00:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-什么目的  -算笔旧账\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Settle an old score.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的姑娘长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My girl's grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会饶你一命  但有个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll spare your life on one condition --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放迪恩安全离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe passage for Dean out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-阿玛拉消失了  -她是怎么逃走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amara is in the wind. - How'd she get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"上帝的妹妹"这句话你没听明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What part of "God's frickin' sister" did you not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们永远都会帮助彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will always help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝没分享过他的想法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose God's decided to share any wisdom on the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地狱里有个笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this cage in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法被关在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's where they keep Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.53,0:00:42.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾被关在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've been in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.47,0:00:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝好像想让我回到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think God wants me to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.57,0:00:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的  我们会找到其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not happening. We'll find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他办法是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.73,0:00:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忏悔罪孽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repent your sins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.26,0:01:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.19,0:01:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请求上帝宽恕吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg for his divine mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等末日到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the end comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.95,0:01:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拯救我们吧  主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save us, lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.97,0:01:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那一日必将到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And come it will,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.01,0:01:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有被宽恕者能升入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}only the forgiven will ascend to holy grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在看着  他在等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's watching. He's waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.81,0:01:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是在说上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is God you're speaking of?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.92,0:01:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得他在看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think he's watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在对我们进行评判\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deciding which of us is worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.90,0:01:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有获选之人能升入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the chosen will be raised to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.93,0:01:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and that's...you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.64,0:01:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  我觉得他根本不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truthfully, I don't think he's all that interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎都没怎么出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't even seem to be around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我找过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I've searched.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop right there, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快祈求他的宽恕吧  否则就等着他降下盛怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beg for his forgiveness or face his terrible wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.69,0:01:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -是吗  他会生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right! - Really? Gets annoyed, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.09,0:01:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的盛怒有多种形式\N{\fnArial\fs30}His wrath comes in many forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但只有上帝能制造\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only God is able to create
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-可怕的瘟疫和毁灭  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the fearsome plague and destruction... - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:01:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地球上的凡人必须皆向其屈服\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all on earth must bow before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.67,0:02:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-正义在等着呢  -你是指这种吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Justice is waiting! - You mean something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(忏悔吧  罪人)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it...you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(天堂国度近在咫尺)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.56,0:02:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在试炼我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you testing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.18,0:02:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝吗  不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you mean? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.95,0:02:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's just say
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是这儿的唯一玩家\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's not the only game in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(末日将近)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  想的美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey, you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第11季第9集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真的是答案吗  这真是你想要的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this really the answer? Is this what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这太疯狂了  而且绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's crazy, okay? And it's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说多少次  这是个坏主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to say that this is a horrible idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.81,0:04:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我要说多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}About as many times as I have to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.12,0:04:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"好吧  那还有什么办法"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Okay, then what else we got?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.49,0:04:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我愿听你出主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm all ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我一般会同意你的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, ordinarily, I'd agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.03,0:04:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但只有我向上帝求助时才会看到这些幻象\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the visions only happen when I reach out to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我问他如何打败黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked him for a way to beat the Darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:43.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而幻象也变得更加具体\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the visions got more specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And...I was in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  跟路西法在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, with Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史上最可怕的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}the biggest monster ever hatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:50.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-简直太棒了  -知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fan-freakin'-tastic. - You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法本来是史上最可怕的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer was the biggest monster ever hatched,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到你跟我放出了更可怕的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}until you and I hatched one that's even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:04:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  在幻象里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, in the vision,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}touches me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I feel...calm,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(宗教集会遭遇闪电  8人被劈死)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉就像  不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like things will be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而这种事我自己是想不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's not something I would ever come up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会那么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that is the last thing I would ever think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.75,0:05:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果路西法碰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer touched you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就不会再有任何想法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would be the last thing you think, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝为什么会要你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would God even ask this of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  我们怎么能证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what? What proof do we have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一切是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that any of this is actually real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个灌木丛着火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a burning bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.23,0:05:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,灌木丛着火\N{\fnArial\fs30}A burning bush?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.13,0:05:33.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像《圣经》里那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like in the bible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当时在树林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.65,0:05:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那里有灌木丛  有时候他们自己就会着火\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are bushes there and sometimes they burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.81,0:05:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.69,0:05:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这里面的确有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe there is something to it all. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.57,0:05:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也或许没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe there's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这说得通啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, doesn't it make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法肯定知道上帝是如何终结黑暗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Lucifer would know how God ended the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:05:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他当时也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝向你保证了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So God assured you of this, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是你编的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say you're making this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.34,0:06:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒从未觉得你这人有什么想象力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I never think of you as imaginative.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.98,0:06:14.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没说真会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not saying it's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.37,0:06:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想知道  理论上来讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wanna know... theoretically,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.23,0:06:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是否有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}...if it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笼子是不该打开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cage is a can of worms you do not want to open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-我们的谈话结束了  -是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I believe this conversation is over. - Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.05,0:06:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力  你知道黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, you know that the Darkness is gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会放过任何事物  包括你\N{\fnArial\fs30}pound on everything, and that includes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  本来她之前在你手里时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and you had a shot at taking her out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有机会除掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she was with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但显然你以为讨好她会更合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}but apparently, you thought that sucking up was the way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可结果却不怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that didn't work out so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.13,0:06:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为她选了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because she chose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你控制不好自己的女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you couldn't control your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时在房间里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened in that room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她为什么非要饶你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did she insist on sparing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她对你来说算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道她是什么吗  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know what she is, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝的妹妹怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about God's sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝的妹妹  他还有亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's sister? He has relatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.69,0:07:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来有那么好的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had that kind of leverage under my thumb
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.04,0:07:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,居然被我放走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I let it slip away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能不能专注于大局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we focus on the big picture here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.61,0:07:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆能不能跟路西法见个面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can Sam meet with Lucifer or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-在笼子里  -不  不能在笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the cage. - No, not in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那我就见不到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then I don't meet with Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.74,0:07:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们不能放他出来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we can't let him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许有个办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There may be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:08:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用说  如果萨姆进笼子  就出不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Clearly, if Sam enters the cage, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  这的确在我的遗愿清单上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, yes, it's on my bucket list,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.76,0:08:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在不是自私的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now's not the time to be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要一个安全的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a secure site,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想办法遏制路西法的法力\N{\fnArial\fs30}a way to neutralize Lucifer's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.51,0:08:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  在地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我们多少还能控制着点局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have a modicum of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.06,0:08:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我希望那怪物跑来楼上捣乱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I want that abomination running amok upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.35,0:08:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是否可以控制局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it possible to control the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:25.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不能保证萨姆安全  就休想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if Sam's not safe, it's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天啊  妈妈  别管那么严\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodness mummy, loosen the grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理论上  有可能  有些困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically, it's possible. There are challenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以安排你们下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can arrange a transit into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但开笼子就是另一码事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Opening the cage, that's another matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是地狱之王啊  你没钥匙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the king of the joint. Don't you have a key?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是上帝本人封印的  我当然"没钥匙"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was sealed by God himself. Of course I don't "have a key."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,机关是上帝制造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mechanism is of divine manufacture.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.65,0:08:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为它的奥秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe its secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及能保护萨姆的咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}along with the spells for warding Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.58,0:08:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,与其他类似秘密都被记录在了一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}are recorded where many such mysteries are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 《诅咒之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Book of the Damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.30,0:09:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-太棒了  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, that's wonderful. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴再次见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you again, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  玛丽  你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello, Mary. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:34.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-好多了  谢谢  -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, better. Thank you. - Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.73,0:09:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾格尼丝  见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agnes, always a pleasure. Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是负责人吗  我在找上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in charge here? I'm looking for God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.98,0:09:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在万事万物里寻找上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all look for God in all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是需要找间屋子跟他见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I need an actual meeting, in a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是最合适的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.15,0:09:56.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:10:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想找到他  就得通过祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the way to reach him is through prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.33,0:10:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像他们那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like them, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. Take her out for a spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.33,0:10:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.47,0:10:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然好使的  他能听到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course it's working. He heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他承诺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.47,0:10:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so you have seen him then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no one has.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少在世的没人见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-at least, no one alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.42,0:10:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  只有死人能看到他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. So only dead people get to see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们几十亿人觉得这没问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this makes sense to billions of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,信仰就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the nature of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.34,0:10:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's... it's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝的仁慈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mercy of god,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.02,0:10:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他对世界和人类的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}his love of the world and mankind,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他为我们准备的完美计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}his... his perfect plan for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.78,0:10:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是操纵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.53,0:10:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是相信他希望你相信的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only believe what he wants you to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:58.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是啊  -你根本不知道他什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exactly. - You don't know what he is like at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.13,0:11:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We certainly do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.63,0:11:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝是光\N{\fnArial\fs30}God is the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正是光战胜了黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is the light that vanquishes the Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母亲  多谢你前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother. Good of you to stop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放开我  白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unhand me, you...goons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,费格斯  你以为你赢了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Fergus, think you've won?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.62,0:11:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你敢碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay a hand on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的追随者就会用《诅咒之书》的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my followers will swoop down on this tin can palace of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.17,0:11:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,围攻你这座锡罐王宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}with all the power of The Book of the Damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴吧  你个满口谎言的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stow it, you lying bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能做到  你早做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you could do that, you'd have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.27,0:11:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我想杀你  我也早做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I wanted to kill you, I'd have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可不是没试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that you haven't tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你两次企图杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to kill me twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说的来着  第三次保准成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it they say? Third time's the charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:14.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要把我交给他们俩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're not handing me over to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你都不该这么下作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beneath even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.15,0:12:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们也是你的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're your enemies as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  罗威娜  没错  我们都是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Rowena, we get it. We're all enemies. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:23.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在  我们有更要紧的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right now, we got bigger fish to fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.75,0:12:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之后我们可以再继续互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we can go back to killing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.87,0:12:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,善恶终有报啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chicken's come home to roost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,血印被祛除时  有可怕的力量被释放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ghastly force set free when the mark was removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.72,0:12:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.00,0:12:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听过传言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard whispers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.69,0:12:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真如他们说的那么糟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As bad as they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧  这个房间里每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's just say that everyone in this room
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.05,0:12:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许都有把它关回去的一部分办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}might hold a piece of the puzzle to corking it back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那等危险过去之后  我又会如何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens to me once the danger's past?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道我能信任你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know I can trust any of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:13:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都不知道  这是魔鬼的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us do. It's a devil's bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.75,0:13:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  所有天使必须团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a time for all angels to pull together,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放下我们的争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}to put aside our disagreements,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让那些老大们看看  如何挽救天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and show the big bosses how to save heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不被夺去\N{\fnArial\fs30}from being taken over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为正是我们这些小兵会被踢到一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it's grunts like us who'll get kicked aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗对上帝所有的创造物都有打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Darkness has a plan for every one of God's creations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,夺取天堂  这怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take over heaven? How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  是谁让她当上帝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, who made her god?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.01,0:13:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  丹尼尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Daniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:30.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我一样熟知那些传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the stories as well as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.79,0:13:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她法力高强  吞没一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All powerful, all consuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的仇是跟上帝  不是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her beef is with god, not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.94,0:13:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他把她关了起来  该由他来摆平此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He locked her away. It's on him to make this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你下次见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you tell him that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己去跟他说这话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}next time you see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他根本不在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他把她关了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He locked her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得她不会想毁掉他所创造的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't think she's gonna wanna get even
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来向他报复吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}by tearing apart anything he ever made?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.09,0:14:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要带领我们抵抗她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna lead us against her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你从未领导过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never led anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.10,0:14:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么就不好了  毕竟我们的领袖成天\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that a bad thing, when our leaders do nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.83,0:14:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就知道挑拨各派系之间的矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}but pit the factions against each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事得靠我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is in our laps, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把话传出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要放下争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get past our differences.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要联合起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We stand united.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这能是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can this be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}His sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们那年代  哪怕这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, in my day, we'd all be burnt at the stake
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.28,0:14:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都会被捆在柱子上烧死\N{\fnArial\fs30}for even thinking any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.18,0:14:43.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  母亲  你看得出事情多么紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see then, mother, the need for urgency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.77,0:14:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我破译这本书这么要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if my deciphering of the book is so pivotal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:49.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道我有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to know what's in it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.15,0:14:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了饶你一命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, other than your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你做个交易吧  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make you a little deal, mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你乖乖地帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pitch in, like a good girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就叫我的刺客收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call off my assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你暂时再不用提心吊胆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more looking over your shoulder...for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.77,0:15:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要法典  这不用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need the codex, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有查理编程的译码器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the code breaker Charlie devised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.85,0:15:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能受限查阅  在监督之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you'll get limited access. Supervised.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要知道  如何打开笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know exactly this... how to open the cage
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.07,0:15:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等笼子打开后  如何保护萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how to protect Sam once it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这笼子里究竟有什么那么危险的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what's in this cage that's so dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最初的黑暗王子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The original dark prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  坏蛋大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, an archangel so badass
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被上帝亲自丢进了笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he was personally dumped into the cage by God himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们赶紧开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to it then, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.55,0:16:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能看到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这些宠儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your favorites,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.67,0:16:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的天选之民\N{\fnArial\fs30}all your chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are suffering!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Hey, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.31,0:17:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉让你负责看着女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to stick you with witch duty,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然听上去很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}as fun as that sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:06.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们要找的东西绝对在书里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the stuff we're looking for is definitely in the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别乱翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}No snooping around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:14.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,集中注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在教堂有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything at the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.63,0:17:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚到  警察说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, just got here. The cops said that the, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后看到活着的这些被害人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}the last time the vics were seen alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其中一位  一个牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of them a priest,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在跟一个神秘的女人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were talking to some mystery woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.64,0:17:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她没有遇害\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was not killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-是阿玛拉吗  -一定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amara? - Yeah, I'm bettin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.60,0:17:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面就是屠杀现场  到处是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, it's a massacre. The place is covered in blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的行为升级了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's upping her game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.64,0:17:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她早晚会让我们招架不住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna pass the point where we can deal with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听好  你确定你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, are you sure that you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.12,0:17:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的愿意这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're okay with this whole deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  一点也不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not even a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.92,0:17:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还有什么选择呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what choice do we have, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那我要说  我讨厌这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, for the record, I hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等着我  我到之前别干傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait for me. Don't do anything until I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在只是在研究  但  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now it's just research, but you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.96,0:17:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:17:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:02.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还谈信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk about trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.93,0:18:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和你嗜血的哥哥说我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your bloodthirsty brother say we're partners
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.45,0:18:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对付阿玛拉的圣战搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this holy war against Amara,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.71,0:18:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.35,0:18:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么信任我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}trussed like a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿着《诅咒之书》坐在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sitting there with The Book of the Damned
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且有破解咒语的一切手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the means to read every word,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.05,0:18:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会放你自由吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you think I'm gonna set you free?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:29.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对你霸道的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you do have unresolved issues
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.05,0:18:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和父亲的抛弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your domineering older brother
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有未解开的心结啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the abandonment by your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.70,0:18:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶紧继续工作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Just get back to work, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running out of time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.62,0:18:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要些原料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll need some ingredients,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你可以把费格斯叫来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you may summon Fergus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫他推个手推车来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell him to bring a handcart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.06,0:18:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手推车\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handcart?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.90,0:19:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  来一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,(萨姆来电)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  一切就绪  费格斯要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, everything is in order. Fergus is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.20,0:20:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我向迪恩保证过会打给他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised Dean I'd call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还向林肯保证过晚上观剧会很愉快呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised Lincoln a fun night at the theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事情总会变  必须马上行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things change. It's now or never.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.39,0:20:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你感到了我的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You felt my presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以才来到了这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.45,0:21:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grew up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:07.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.47,0:21:11.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在是这样了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.94,0:21:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少今天是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.53,0:21:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,担心吗  对即将发生的事感到害怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flop sweat, sonny? Dread of what's to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.46,0:21:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的俏皮话或许在女巫圈里吃得开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your barbs may amuse your circle of hags,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.81,0:21:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你根本不知道你要面对的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have no idea what you're tampering with,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.84,0:21:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道路西法的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what Lucifer is capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.70,0:21:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  你如果承受不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, dear, if you can't stand the heat,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就离开地狱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}get out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说  风景不如我想的那么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must say, it's not as scenic as I'd expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在地狱最深处  边缘地带\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the furthest reaches of hell... limbo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.70,0:21:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只把最不守规矩的灵魂送来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I send unruly souls for time-outs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.14,0:21:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要在这儿见路西法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where I meet with Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.36,0:22:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然气氛不佳  但绝对安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}What it lacks in ambience, it makes up for in security.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.01,0:22:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真让人皮肤发麻  是吧  小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes your flesh crawl, doesn't it, moose?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是这里的国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the king of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是不喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still not my cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.69,0:22:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  克劳力  我倒觉得这里适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Crowley. I'd say it suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.57,0:22:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.36,0:22:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,空虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真棒  还这么鄙视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating, the utter contempt,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.82,0:22:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正要救你们温家人的命呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I'm in the midst of saving the Winchesters' bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.93,0:22:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且是又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.05,0:22:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是为了救每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point of this is to save everyone's bacon,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.29,0:22:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包括你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}including yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:46.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望她是真的心里有数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just hope she knows what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.92,0:22:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果防护咒不对  牢房什么都困不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cell won't hold crap if the warding's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.27,0:22:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别担心我  萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry about me, Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可是专业人士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.19,0:22:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定你真可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're certain you can do this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.57,0:23:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用真正打开笼子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}without actually opening the cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.41,0:23:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to find out, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.73,0:23:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.22,0:23:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试试笼子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...let's have a go at that cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.85,0:23:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.75,0:23:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.65,0:23:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你误解了我想在地球上做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You misunderstand my purpose on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.57,0:23:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我误解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do I misunderstand
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.52,0:23:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在公园屠杀的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the people you butchered in that park?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.75,0:24:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有教堂的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or in that church?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.58,0:24:02.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我总得想办法引起他的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to get his attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.73,0:24:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-他  -上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "His"? - God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.06,0:24:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我试过祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried praying,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向他求助\N{\fnArial\fs30}calling out in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.93,0:24:14.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他无视了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ignored me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.48,0:24:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是他迫我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He forced my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我没理由伤害他的天选之民\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no other reason to harm his chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.81,0:24:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只跟我哥哥有仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}My issue is with my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.30,0:24:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而不是他的创造物\N{\fnArial\fs30}not his creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.45,0:24:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无论你们两个之间是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the deal is between you two,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.36,0:24:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁先动的手  谁是老爹的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}whoever threw the first punch, whoever was daddy's favorite...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.53,0:24:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有老爹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.90,0:24:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.77,0:24:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That mess is your mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.22,0:24:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩之间的纠葛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's between you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.11,0:24:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可你在夺取他人性命  他们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're taking people's lives. You're taking their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.16,0:24:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是吞噬了他们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I consumed their souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.02,0:24:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们并没有消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.28,0:25:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是成为了我的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.94,0:25:05.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样他们可以获得永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in that way, they live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.50,0:25:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的老朋友克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old friend Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.24,0:26:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只不过是小助手  继承你的衣钵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mere acolyte, carrying your torch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.18,0:26:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.43,0:26:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对你自己好\N{\fnArial\fs30}To yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.62,0:26:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.45,0:26:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.56,0:26:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的老室友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My old roomie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.99,0:26:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱一个呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hug it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.89,0:26:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说  这见面让我有点懵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}I gotta say, I'm a little in the dark about this meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.41,0:26:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是要让我假释吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I up for parole?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.12,0:27:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因不良表现而获得休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time off for bad behavior?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.75,0:27:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一般没人来探监的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really get visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.14,0:27:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是上面情势危急\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for the crisis topside,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.82,0:27:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn't be getting one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.03,0:27:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,危急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crisis?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.95,0:27:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他好有男人味啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so alpha, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.31,0:27:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过大概不太适合谈恋爱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably not relationship material, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.85,0:27:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母亲  流哈喇子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother, you're drooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.42,0:27:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请自重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ahold of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道黑暗的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're aware of the Darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.16,0:27:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎哟  听上去不妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yikes. That... that doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.55,0:27:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道她曾经是什么  但那都是很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware of what she was, but that was eons ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.69,0:27:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她被放出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been released,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.73,0:27:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以她正在某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}so now she's somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.95,0:27:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者说在地球上的任何一个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}or everywhere on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.95,0:27:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么发生这种事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}However did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是  她对所有的存在都构成了威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is, she poses a threat to all that exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.18,0:28:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,包括你在内\N{\fnArial\fs30}including you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.68,0:28:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就不得不问第二个问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that leads me to my next question.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.59,0:28:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,墨西哥卷饼兄呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the big burrito himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.09,0:28:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's God in all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.51,0:28:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有迹象表明\N{\fnArial\fs30}All current indications of his presence
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.10,0:28:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}are that there are no current indications of his presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.44,0:28:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.41,0:28:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搭大巴出城玩去啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught the fun bus out of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.86,0:28:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不出所料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.33,0:28:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.20,0:28:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他最近跟一位相关方取得了联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recently he has reached out to an interested party.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.76,0:28:49.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.76,0:28:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.22,0:28:54.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.04,0:28:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他回应了我的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He answered my prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.42,0:29:00.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.18,0:29:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老爸提出了什么建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what was dad's suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.72,0:29:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}To seek out you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.71,0:29:13.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.83,0:29:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.14,0:29:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是没想到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd have thunk it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.68,0:29:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在你眼中看到了疲倦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the weariness in your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.53,0:29:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mistrust.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.71,0:29:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.50,0:29:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.68,0:29:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.17,0:29:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这政治宣传能影响这么深远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How it endures, the propaganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.13,0:29:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他深感到我的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was so threatened by me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.65,0:29:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害怕我会实现更完美的造物\N{\fnArial\fs30}fearful that I would make a more perfect creation than he,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.02,0:29:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是他放逐了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he exiled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.06,0:29:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抹杀了我的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virtually erased me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.64,0:29:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通过流传的故事说我是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passed on stories that I was a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.55,0:29:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你哥哥则毫不谦虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}While your brother was going all Kanye,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.97,0:30:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自吹自擂\N{\fnArial\fs30}blowing his horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.53,0:30:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他鼓励宗教是作为他自负的纪念碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He encouraged religions as monuments to his ego,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.69,0:30:08.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,承诺唯唯诺诺者只要崇拜他  就能得到庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}promised the fearful safety if they'd adore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.09,0:30:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能听他说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}His way or the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.37,0:30:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些人在这其中找到了安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people find comfort in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.55,0:30:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄金法则  哥哥的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golden rule, brother's keeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.48,0:30:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他的世界  他的规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is his universe, his rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.96,0:30:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有规则会怎样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if there were no rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.45,0:30:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有痛苦  没有祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pain? No prayer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.53,0:30:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有  极乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.34,0:30:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我在一起时  就会有的那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That feeling that you have when you're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.80,0:30:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都会永远享有极乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everyone, forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.62,0:30:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能听到他们在说什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear what they're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.18,0:30:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你闭嘴我就能听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could if you'd just shut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.73,0:30:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全明白你为什么来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I completely get why you came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.06,0:31:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝不容无视  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't ignore God, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.63,0:31:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝说"跳"  所有人就回"跳多高"\N{\fnArial\fs30}God says, "Jump," everybody says, "How high?"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.09,0:31:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你入伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does this mean you're on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.69,0:31:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.47,0:31:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多年前  我的确有帮老爸封印了黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did help dad seal up the Darkness all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.73,0:31:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真的很难缠\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's quite a force.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.23,0:31:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即便是当时  就一心想篡夺大权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Determined to take over everything even back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.31,0:31:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脾气特别大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prone to tantrums.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.06,0:31:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能明白老爸为什么要躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see why pop is laying low.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.43,0:31:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,话真多啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of blabber going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.23,0:31:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆总知道不能跟他做交易吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely Sam knows better than to cut some sort of deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.14,0:31:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实呢  费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Fergus,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.91,0:31:40.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时达成协议  即便是痛苦的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes striking a deal, even a painful one,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.18,0:31:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是唯一的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}may be the only option.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.23,0:31:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比如你对我下的刺杀令吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the hit you took out on me, for instance?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.73,0:31:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为人父母不容易啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not easy being a parent,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.01,0:31:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要清楚何时该拥抱孩子  何时该杀掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing when to hug your child, when to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.38,0:31:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妹妹一来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that sis is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.96,0:31:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝就不是唯一的狠角色了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's not the only circus in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.85,0:31:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的力量跟上帝一样强大吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she equal to him in power?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.61,0:32:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纯粹力量吗  当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raw power? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.65,0:32:03.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she's got none of the...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.85,0:32:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.73,0:32:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝可是个大谋略家\N{\fnArial\fs30}God is a master strategist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.28,0:32:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你才会来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.68,0:32:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.34,0:32:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为上帝需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, 'cause God needs me
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.03,0:32:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮他把猫抓回袋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to help put the cat back in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.82,0:32:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他自己干不了这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't do it by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.43,0:32:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这我经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen that movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.89,0:32:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.93,0:32:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要搭"车"出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need a ride out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.41,0:32:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里面看着还挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I look swell in here and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.91,0:32:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但到了地面  我会变成黑烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'd be so much smoke topside.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.42,0:32:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.87,0:32:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一具\N{\fnArial\fs30}One who's...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.33,0:32:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,强大到足以容纳我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong enough to hold me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}handy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.99,0:32:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在就能用的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and available now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.96,0:32:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,理解我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch my drift?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.05,0:33:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你具体想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it exactly that you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.66,0:33:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把世界变得"极乐"  "安宁"之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you make the world of "bliss" and "peace,"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.63,0:33:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,-你会得到什么  -我应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what's in it for you? - What I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.35,0:33:11.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.44,0:33:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.69,0:33:15.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.14,0:33:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是原初  也将会是终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the beginning, and I will be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.32,0:33:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会成为唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be all that there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.39,0:33:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.26,0:33:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是上帝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would make you God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.38,0:33:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.25,0:33:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上帝是光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}God was the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.38,0:33:37.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.89,0:33:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.20,0:33:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在只需要知道这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all you need to know for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.62,0:34:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定知道那是没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to know that was pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.29,0:34:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你是名战士  抵抗是你的本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you're a warrior and your instinct is to resist,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.80,0:34:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}but...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.65,0:34:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不可抗拒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be resisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.68,0:34:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得我会同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really expect me to agree to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.92,0:34:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我消失  你占据我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, I just disappear, while you take my body
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.50,0:34:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑到外面去为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get set loose on the world again?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.08,0:35:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我理解  萨姆  这要求确实有点过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know, Sam. It's a lot to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.13,0:35:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是非常时刻要采取非常举措\N{\fnArial\fs30}But desperate times require desperate measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.33,0:35:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是非常  是疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not desperate. That's certifiable!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.95,0:35:11.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别急  牛仔  深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold on there a second, cowboy. Take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.01,0:35:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还跟克劳力合作呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been working with Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.41,0:35:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你早已过了疯狂的边界了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You passed certifiable three off-ramps ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.84,0:35:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不喜欢宇宙之主\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look, I'm no fan of the ruler of the universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.47,0:35:27.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是愿意帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}but here I am, ready to pitch in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.51,0:35:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你以为上帝为什么让你来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, why do you think God sent you to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.28,0:35:37.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是让你来寻求帮助  而我刚说愿意帮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get my help, which I only now just offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.68,0:35:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你的幻象是上帝之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, your visions were the word of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.20,0:35:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能拒绝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't say no to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.69,0:35:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.23,0:35:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.79,0:36:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们相遇的必然结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The inevitable result of our first meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.48,0:36:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们初遇之后你一直有的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you've been feeling since that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.20,0:36:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we both felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.50,0:36:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是紧密相连的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we're bonded.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.49,0:36:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是释放了我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who set me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.71,0:36:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那只是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.20,0:36:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.30,0:36:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你传承了血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bore the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.85,0:36:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是最初的血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the original mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.06,0:36:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我必将在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I will be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.44,0:36:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.14,0:36:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's... that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.33,0:36:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这很简单  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so simple, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.00,0:36:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将成为一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.84,0:36:41.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不想那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.73,0:36:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.57,0:36:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要向我们投降  去天堂接受审判\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to surrender to us and to the judgment of heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.62,0:36:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要屈服于上帝创造的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why ever would I submit to anything of God's creation?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.29,0:36:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让你们的主人亲自来抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your master to come fetch me himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.57,0:36:59.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天堂全体都高度警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of heaven's on high alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.50,0:37:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你反抗  天空中的每个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you resist, each and every angel in the skies
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.90,0:37:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会合力一击毁灭你\N{\fnArial\fs30}will smite you in a single unified blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.07,0:37:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连你都无力抵御\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even you could survive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.89,0:37:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  别激动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellas, dial it down a bit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.88,0:37:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you take her down,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.05,0:37:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会有很多人一起陪葬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a whole bunch of people are gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.87,0:37:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  牺牲已在所难免\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at the point where sacrifice is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.53,0:37:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿玛拉  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amara, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.04,0:37:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.02,0:38:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.04,0:38:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会毁灭你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will smite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.13,0:38:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许现在他会听到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe now he'll hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.27,0:38:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.70,0:39:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你考虑过了吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So have you thought about it, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.80,0:39:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能期待你的邀请吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have an invitation to look forward to?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.54,0:39:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.68,0:39:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.71,0:39:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定还有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.53,0:39:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.57,0:39:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么保护咒失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did the warding fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.06,0:39:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.26,0:39:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走  费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me, Fergus.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.76,0:40:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.00,0:40:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·温彻斯特  想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sam Winchester, you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.62,0:40:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.90,0:40:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得说  考虑到现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say, you're... you're extraordinarily calm
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.22,0:40:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是格外冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}given the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.82,0:40:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这和上帝跟我说的情况基本一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty much exactly how God told me it was gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.86,0:40:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我只能照做  碰运气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I just have to go with it and play my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.66,0:40:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本该说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that would make so much sense
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.71,0:40:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果跟你说话的是上帝的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it was God that was doing the talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.01,0:40:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧  萨姆  黑暗降临时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Sam, when the Darkness descended,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.25,0:40:52.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对地狱的影响非常大\N{\fnArial\fs30}the impact on hell was massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.23,0:40:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笼子被损坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cage was damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.22,0:40:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我通过裂缝  探了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the fissures, I was able to reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.33,0:41:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,进入你头脑的并不是上帝  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't God inside your head, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.84,0:41:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.75,0:41:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.36,0:41:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他并不与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's not with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.50,0:41:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从未与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never been with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.72,0:41:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always just...me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.72,0:41:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.86,0:41:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我的确是你唯一的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I am your only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.35,0:41:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.64,0:41:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.28,0:41:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就住下吧  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settle in there, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.34,0:41:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,室友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, roomie...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.68,0:41:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上铺  下铺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upper bunk? Lower bunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.40,0:41:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是想睡一张床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you wanna share?

